cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ado-coastline in academic work, please cite the MSc thesis
  (preferred-citation below). Cite this file when you need to refer to a
  specific released version of the software itself.
title: ado-coastline
abstract: >-
  ado custom experiments that expose the COASTLINE recommender: they reuse the
  AutoConf feasibility check and rank the feasible GPU layouts by a
  performance/energy trade-off (Kavier analytical throughput and power).
